  "passage": "Yesterday, thirteen-year-old Sam and his friends decided to have a barbecue in the city park. It was a foggy morning, but they were certain the weather would improve by afternoon. They packed a cooler with food, including eggs for making an omelette later, and set off on their bikes. On the way, they cycled past the old railway station, which always reminded them of their history lessons about the industrial revolution. When they arrived at the park, they found a perfect spot near the modern art gallery. While setting up the barbecue, Sam noticed a warning sign about fire safety rules. He quickly called his friends over to read it, and they made sure to follow all the instructions carefully. After enjoying their meal, they decided to visit the gallery and saw an exhibition of local artists. It was a fantastic day, and they felt lucky to have such exciting adventures together.",
